      {
        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Direct a Short Film\n\nTurns a one-line brief into a rendered short film. A language model writes the screenplay and narration, then each shot is filmed and cut together.\n\n**How it works:** \"Your brief\" feeds \"Creative director\", which returns a screenplay, a title and narration. \"Shot list\" splits the screenplay into shots. \"Film the shots\" generates each clip, seeding later shots from the previous clip's last frame. \"Assemble\" places the clips on a timeline, \"Render\" exports it, and the three outputs show the film, title and narration.\n\n**Try this:** Change the \"Creative director\" shot count from 3 to 5. Cost grows with each shot."
        },
